pan><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></code></pre></div></code></div><br></span></div>How can I make for loop reactive and put it outside `output` function so that all `output` functions could access the h variables?<div><br></div><div>Note: question posted on stackoverflow as well.</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
